WEBVTT

00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:05.739
View and announce results

00:00:05.789 --> 00:00:08.899
Open Academics, then Results.

00:00:13.436 --> 00:00:18.405
Choose the class and the exam to see the computed results with marks and grades.

00:00:23.385 --> 00:00:27.138
Review the results for accuracy before you announce them.

00:00:30.282 --> 00:00:35.111
To make results visible, open Exams and expand the exam group.

00:00:37.918 --> 00:00:44.636
Press Announce Results, then confirm. Students and parents can now see the results.

00:00:49.965 --> 00:00:54.647
Results announced
